*> vybe-test: cobol/cobol2023_nested/nested_with_inner_call_runtime
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_cobol2023_nested.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. OUTER.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-SHARED PIC X(20) VALUE "Shared".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY WS-SHARED.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-SHARED DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "Shared"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [Shared] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    CALL "INNER"
    END-CALL
    STOP RUN.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INNER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Inner".
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "Inner" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "Inner"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [Inner] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM INNER.
END PROGRAM OUTER.

